{
  "suite": "value_date_text_recogniser",
  "description": "VALUE / DATEVALUE / TIMEVALUE / implicit coercion of date and time text: month-name forms, numeric pair fallbacks (m/d -> d/m -> y/m), two-digit year window, time field limits and millisecond rounding, trailing separators, date+time order, fullwidth folding, kanji and era forms. Year-less forms are anchored to DATE(YEAR(TODAY()),m,d) so goldens do not depend on the capture year (no Feb-29 shapes, whose fallback is leap-dependent).\n",
